@startuml
title UC-02 EXT - Add optional Resource Type outputs
autonumber
actor "Platform Engineer" as PE
boundary ResourceTypeController as API
control ResourceTypeService as Service
entity ResourceType as Validator
database ResourceTypeRepository as Repo

PE -> API: AddOutputs(key, outputs) [EXT-01]
API -> Service: AddResourceTypeOutputs(ctx, org, key, outputs)
Service -> Validator: Validate new fields (optional, supported type, not workload) [EXT-01, EXT-03]
Validator --> Service: valid
Service -> Repo: AppendResourceTypeOutputs(org, key, outputs) <<transaction>>
note right of Repo
Locks the Type row; rejects a name that
already exists (EXT-02). Existing fields,
inputs and key are never rewritten.
end note
Repo --> Service: ResourceType
Service --> API: ResourceType
API --> PE: Outputs added [EXT-04, EXT-06]
@enduml
